{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2021-11-17 16:15:00', 'title': 'SEMPRA DECLARES COMMON DIVIDEND', 'text': "SAN DIEGO, NOV. 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SEMPRA\xa0(NYSE: SRE) (BMV: SRE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A $1.10 PER SHARE\xa0QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK, WHICH IS PAYABLE JAN. 15, 2022, TO COMMON STOCK SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0DEC. 23, 2021. ABOUT SEMPRA SEMPRA'S MISSION IS TO BE\xa0NORTH AMERICA'S\xa0PREMIER ENERGY INFRASTRUCTURE COMPANY."}